-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
-- alge · 100 seed conversations
--
-- Purpose: an empty globe asks a visitor to be the first person to speak, which
-- almost nobody does. These 100 questions give the space something to be, so a
-- real user arrives with something to answer instead of a blank sphere.
--
-- HONESTY: every row is authored by '.bro' — the house account. None of them
-- impersonate a person. Nothing here pretends to be user-generated.
--
-- Arrangement: 6 categories balanced (18/18/18/16/15/15), interleaved so no
-- cluster lights up alone, placed across 42 real cities weighted toward the
-- IIT Mandi beachhead, and back-dated across ~34 days so the space reads as
-- having a history rather than a single dump.
--
-- Reversible — remove every seeded row with:
--     DELETE FROM questions WHERE name = '.bro';
-- (replies to them cascade only if you drop those first — see the note below)
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

